flowchart LR
    ChangeEvent[ChangeEvent HISTORICAL_CORRECTION] -->|TARGETS_HISTORY| History[PiH immutable]
    ChangeEvent -. expectedHistoryViewHash .-> View[effective HistoryView]
    Correction[HistoricalCorrection] -->|CORRECTS| History
    Correction -->|CAUSED_BY| ChangeEvent
    Correction -->|CORRECTED_BY| Assignment[RoleAssignment]
    Correction -->|USES_EVIDENCE| Evidence
    SyncEvent -->|CREATES_CORRECTION| Correction
    ChangeEvent -->|TRIGGERS| SyncEvent[SyncEvent after completed run]
    Correction -. baseHistoryViewHash must match .-> View
    Correction -. correctedFields disjoint or one active predecessor superseded .-> FieldCheck{field conflict check}
    Correction -->|SUPERSEDES| Previous[one overlapping active HistoricalCorrection]
